{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんばんは"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "四期生の松本和子(まつもとわこ)です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "開いてくださり、ありがとうございます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mob085ndC.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobuCb7lr.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ちーとかき氷を食べに行きました🧊"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "きなこ味！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "さっぱりしていて美味しかった〜〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "きなこを何口も堪能できることってあまりないから幸せでした♩"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "全然写せてないんだけど、トッピングできる最中がねこちゃんの形でかわいかった🐈"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "また暑いうちにかき氷食べたいな〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "かき氷食べたあと、ちーたんとカラオケに行ったんだけど、図らずともアイドル縛りになってた！\n楽しかったです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/moboafAdb.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最近はちーたんがよく写真撮ってくれるんだ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「青葉坂46」\nオーディションの応募がスタートしました🌱"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "やりたいことをやってみること、\n一歩を踏み出すことは、すごく勇気がいることだと思います"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私は挑戦しなかった後悔、\n選んでいただけなかった苦しさ、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "どちらも経験しました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "でも、挑戦したから、\n今、ここに立たせていただいています"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "『ここから変われ、君の世界。』"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "応募してみる、一歩踏み出してみる、それだけで、世界はほんの少し違って見えると思います"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "応募の期限はまだ長いので、ゆっくり考えて、ゆっくりと準備してみてください"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私は誰にもオーディションを受けることが言えなかったので代わりに、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "応援しています!"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "かっこいい先輩になれるように私も頑張って、待っていますね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "明日は、ツアーの仙台公演！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "たのしみだ〜〜🫛"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "暑いので気をつけてきてくださいね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またね"}], "source": "official"}